### Compra normal — debe APROBAR
POST https://localhost:7100/api/authorizations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "account": "EC0000000001", "cardToken": "tok_9911", "amountMinor": 8000,
  "merchant": "SUPERMAXI", "country": "EC", "channel": "POS" }

